      {
        "number": "269",
        "source_number": "269",
        "group": null,
        "text": "269. 下列有限数列是等比数列吗？\na) $1000,100,10,1,0.1$；\nb) $0.1,0.01,0.001,0.0001$；\nc) $\\frac{1}{16},\\frac{1}{8},\\frac{1}{2},2,8,16$；\nd) $-1,10,-100,1000,-10000$；\ne) $1,1.1,1.11,1.111$；\nf) $5^{-2},5^{-1},5^0,5^1,5^2$.如果是的话，那么它的公比等于多少？",
        "figures": []
      },
      {
        "number": "270",
        "source_number": "270",
        "group": null,
        "text": "270. 求下列等比数列$(b_n)$的前5项，设：\na) $b_1=6$，$q=2$；\nb) $b_1=-16$，$q=\\frac{1}{2}$；\nc) $b_1=\\frac{3}{4}$，$q=-\\frac{2}{3}$；\nd) $b_1=-24$，$q=-1.5$；\ne) $b_1=0.4$，$q=\\sqrt{2}$；\nf) $b_1=1.8$，$q=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}$.",
        "figures": []
      },
      {
        "number": "271",
        "source_number": "271",
        "group": null,
        "text": "271. 已知下列等比数列的前2项，求这些数列的公比与第4项：\na) $3,15,\\cdots$；\nb) $15,3,\\cdots$；\nc) $6,-12,\\cdots$；\nd) $-20,-10,\\cdots$；\ne) $2\\sqrt{2},4,\\cdots$；\nf) $\\frac{1}{3\\sqrt{3}},1,\\cdots$.",
        "figures": []
      },
      {
        "number": "272",
        "source_number": "272",
        "group": null,
        "text": "272. 在下面写出的等比数列$(y_n)$里，前2项是未知的，把它们求出来：\na) $y_1,y_2,24,36,54,\\cdots$；\nb) $y_1,y_2,225,-135,81,\\cdots$.",
        "figures": []
      },
      {
        "number": "273",
        "source_number": "273",
